WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.280
Well, first of all, the black people in Chicago are thrilled that we're getting the illegal

00:00:03.280 --> 00:00:07.400
aliens out of their communities who are stealing their housing, jobs and resources.

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:11.760
You've seen the video of the town halls during the Biden administration, where black citizens

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:16.459
who are native to Chicago were begging to have the illegals taken out of their country.

00:00:16.459 --> 00:00:21.480
What they've done is they've created a system of law in Chicago, in Illinois, where illegal

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:25.040
aliens have far more rights than American citizens.

00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:29.879
If an American citizen, for example, commits a crime of sexual predation against a child,

00:00:29.879 --> 00:00:31.680
they'll cooperate with the FBI.

00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:35.240
If an illegal alien commits a crime of sexual predation against a child, that illegal alien

00:00:35.240 --> 00:00:37.799
will be shielded in an ICE no-go zone.

00:00:37.799 --> 00:00:42.279
I ask you the question, what is the right term to describe a local official declaring

00:00:42.279 --> 00:00:43.799
a no-go zone for ICE?

00:00:43.799 --> 00:00:46.599
Would you tolerate it for FBI, ATF, DEA?

00:00:46.599 --> 00:00:48.200
No, you would not.

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:52.279
But there is an effort to delegitimize the core function of the federal government of

00:00:52.279 --> 00:00:55.040
enforcing our immigration laws and our sovereignty.

00:00:55.040 --> 00:01:00.360
It is domestic terrorism, it is insurrection, and no amount of insane, hyperventilating

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:05.760
lies from Pritzker or Johnson or any other Democratic official will change our minds

00:01:05.760 --> 00:01:06.760
on that.

00:01:06.760 --> 00:01:12.000
ICE officers should not have to live in fear and violence to do their jobs, period.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:19.199
So on the substance of the question, is it the case that as Pritzker frames it, you are

00:01:19.400 --> 00:01:22.000
profiling brown people?

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:27.199
That this immigration crackdown is designed to go after people of color?

